# Template drift allowlist for zudo-css-wisdom (zcss).
# Generated projects start from create-zudo-doc templates; this file lists
# intentional divergences so `pnpm check:template-drift` exits 0.
#
# Format: one repo-relative path per line (no leading slash).
# Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# REGENERATE when bumping create-zudo-doc / @takazudo/zudo-doc: re-run
# `pnpm check:template-drift`, then for each newly-reported file decide whether
# it is an intentional zcss customization (add here, documented) or real drift
# to reconcile (fix the file). Delete an entry when its divergence goes away.

# ── Build-time / gitignored ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# .zfb/ is gitignored; doc-history-meta.json is written at build time by the
# doc-history plugin. Absent in a fresh checkout (CI) → [MISSING IN PROD];
# present + stale locally → [DIFF]. Either way not a tracked-source divergence.
.zfb/doc-history-meta.json

# ── zcss host customizations (base/ files) ────────────────────────────────
# _mdx-components.ts registers the zcss-specific CssPreview / TailwindPreview
# demo components (+ admonitions / CategoryNav) on top of the scaffold defaults.
pages/_mdx-components.ts

# _head-with-defaults.tsx: zcss adds OgTags/TwitterCard og:image, the
# ColorSchemeProvider palette mount, the sidebar-resizer pre-paint script, and
# the favicon set (.ico + 16/32 png).
pages/lib/_head-with-defaults.tsx

# run-b4push.sh is intentionally the zcss gate set (format-free; pin-parity +
# template-drift + typecheck + build + html-validate + link-check).
scripts/run-b4push.sh

# global.css carries the zcss design tokens (Default Dark/Light, p0–p15 palette,
# @theme) plus `@import "@takazudo/zudo-doc/safelist.css"` for the consumed
# package utilities.
src/styles/global.css

# tsconfig.json: zcss adds the @/components/CssPreview + @/components/TailwindPreview
# path aliases and adjusts `exclude` (e2e, scripts/**/__tests__).
tsconfig.json

# ── Feature islands: enabled feature's real impl overrides the base no-op stub
# These three files exist in BOTH base/ (no-op stub) and their feature/ dir
# (real island). zcss has the features enabled, so the production file is the
# real island — which DIFFs against the base stub in the base/ pass.
src/components/desktop-sidebar-toggle.tsx
src/components/doc-history.tsx
src/components/image-enlarge.tsx

# ── claudeResources: package-export approach (vendored copies intentionally
# absent). zcss's plugins/claude-resources-plugin.mjs (identical to template)
# imports the generation step from the npm package
# `@takazudo/zudo-doc/integrations/claude-resources`, so the template's vendored
# src/integrations/claude-resources/* copies + tests are not carried (removed in
# commit ff283b9; build verifies claude docs still generate). CF kept these
# copies; zcss deliberately does not.
src/integrations/claude-resources/escape-for-mdx.ts
src/integrations/claude-resources/generate.ts
src/integrations/claude-resources/__tests__/escape-for-mdx.test.ts
src/integrations/claude-resources/__tests__/generate.test.ts
